deepin-package-file-index (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * Provides libdeepin-pkgfile-index shared library for file-to-package queries.
  * Provides deepin-pkgfile-index-build CLI for index generation.
  * Includes apt post-invoke hook and systemd timer for automatic updates.

